---
import { getAllGames } from '../../lib/games.js';
// Path of the Yaoguai is also named in the cited early-festival research sample.
const additions = new Set(['3739350']);
const games=getAllGames().filter(g=>(g.event || additions.has(String(g.appId))) && g.status==='official_disclosure');
const canonical='https://gameaichecker.com/events/steam-next-fest-october-2026-ai-disclosures/';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Steam Next Fest October 2026 games with AI disclosures | Game AI Checker</title><meta name="description" content="Reviewed Steam Next Fest October 2026 game records with official AI disclosures. Read original wording, scope and dates. Not a complete festival list."/><link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/><link rel="icon" href="/logo.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/><style>:root{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#182437;background:#fcfdff}body{margin:0}header,main{max-width:1080px;margin:auto;padding:24px}a{color:#176bc1}h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.035em}.answer{padding:20px;border:1px solid #dce9f6;background:#eff6ff;border-radius:14px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px;margin:26px 0}article{border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:white}article img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:460/215;object-fit:cover}article div{padding:18px}h2{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 8px}.muted{font-size:13px;color:#667085}p{max-width:75ch}details{padding:18px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px;margin:20px 0}summary{font-weight:650;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:760px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:440px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><header><a href="/">Game AI Checker</a> · <a href="/events/steam-next-fest-october-2026/">All festival records</a></header><main><p class="muted">REVIEWED RECORDS · OCTOBER 2026</p><h1>Next Fest games with official AI disclosures</h1><div class="answer"><strong>{games.length} event-linked games in our reviewed catalogue disclose AI use.</strong><p>This is a selected evidence directory, not a census of Steam Next Fest or a ranking of game quality. Open a game for its original wording and review date.</p></div><p><a href="/guides/how-to-check-steam-game-ai/">How to check a Steam AI disclosure →</a></p><div class="grid">{games.map(g=><article>{g.header && <a href={`/games/en/${g.slug}/`}><img src={g.header} alt={`${g.name} — official Steam cover`} loading="lazy"/></a>}<div><h2><a href={`/games/en/${g.slug}/`}>{g.name}</a></h2><p class="muted">{g.developer}</p><p>{g.usedAreas.length ? `Disclosed areas: ${g.usedAreas.map(a=>a.key).join(', ')}` : 'AI use disclosed; specific areas not stated.'}</p><p class="muted">Reviewed: {g.reviewedAt || 'See record'}</p><a href={`/games/en/${g.slug}/`}>Read disclosure &amp; sources →</a></div></article>)}</div><details><summary>Selection and limits</summary><p>Each entry has an existing reviewed game record, an event link in our catalogue and official disclosure status. Full-game and demo App IDs remain distinct: the record describes the full game unless its source explicitly identifies the demo.</p><p>Additional event evidence: <a href="https://howtomarketagame.com/2026/10/21/how-sloppy-is-the-october-2026-steam-next-fest/">dated Next Fest research naming Path of the Yaoguai</a>.</p><p>Event context: <a href="https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/marketing/upcoming_events/nextfest/2026october">Valve's October 2026 Next Fest documentation</a>. Developer disclosures are self-reports. No disclosure does not prove zero AI use.</p></details><a href="/browse/">Browse all reviewed games →</a></main></body></html>
